  "goodToKnow": "Tabu means taboo or off limits, used after sein: Das ist tabu. Das Tabu is the noun: ein Tabu brechen, ein Tabuthema. Tabuisieren means to make something taboo, and enttabuisieren to break the silence around it, as with mental health. In Germany, everyday taboos include asking strangers about their salary, and for many, discussing which party they vote for. The word came from Polynesian tapu via Captain Cook's travel reports."
